    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 0,
      "text": "Leters Orders and InstructionsEcres",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line000.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 1,
      "text": "2hAerandria Iecmber 1th. 1755.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line001.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 2,
      "text": "A Sergeant and twelve men, to be",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line002.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 3,
      "text": "in readiness to escort a Waggon up to Winchester to-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line003.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 4,
      "text": "morrow.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line004.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 5,
      "text": ". To Sergeant Campbell, of the Virginia Regiment.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line005.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 6,
      "text": "You are to be particularly eareful of the",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line006.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 7,
      "text": "Waggons c. under your charge, and are to see that centi-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line007.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 8,
      "text": "nels are kept over them. If any just complaint ismade",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line008.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 9,
      "text": "of the misbehaviour of the parly under your command,",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line009.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 10,
      "text": "upon their march, you will be punished by a Court mar-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line010.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 11,
      "text": "tial-. You are to see that the waggoners do not loiter",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line011.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 12,
      "text": "or idle their time; but make the utmost dispatch to",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line012.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 13,
      "text": "Winchester. So soon as you arrive at Wincheste,, you",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line013.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 14,
      "text": "are to deliver the things to the Commissary there, and",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line014.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 15,
      "text": "are to take his receipt for them.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line015.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 16,
      "text": "Given at Alexandria, c. December",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line016.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 17,
      "text": "IS. 15.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line017.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 18,
      "text": "TM. aid de camp.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line018.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 19,
      "text": "2th. To Oaptains Parage and  MFengie.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line019.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 20,
      "text": "You are ordered to remain here witk",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line020.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 21,
      "text": "your Recruits until further Orders. So soon asyouar-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line021.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 22,
      "text": "rive here, your men will be supplied with Clothes by",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line022.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 23,
      "text": "applying to  Major Carlyle. If any of your men",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line023.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 24,
      "text": "should desert, you are to use your utmost dili-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line024.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 25,
      "text": "gence in pursuing and apprehending them, by im-",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line025.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 26,
      "text": "mrediately advertising, and sending a partyror",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line026.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
      "line_index": 27,
      "text": "2parties after them.",
      "crop_path": "line_images/307/307_line027.png"
    },
    {
      "page_index": 0,
